\begin_inset Formula \[
\bar{T}=\frac{1}{\mu_{ij}-\lambda_{ij}}=\frac{\bar{X}}{1-\rho}\]

\end_inset 

where 
\begin_inset Formula $\rho=\lambda\bar{X}$
\end_inset 

, the utilization factor.

